# The one place that names the version of appkit's release-kit (https://github.com/WKDSteve/appkit, folder
# release-kit) the workflows take their actions from: `prepare` and `publish`, which put the installers, the
# install scripts of both channels and SHA256SUMS on the rolling build and on a release draft.
#
# It is a pin of its own: the design tokens (tools/appkit-ui.pin) stay on the tag they were copied at, and
# moving them means looking at the window in both themes. tools/check-release-kit-pin.py checks that the tag
# still names this commit and that every `uses: WKDSteve/appkit/...@<sha>` of a workflow is this commit.
# To move to another tag: change both lines and the `uses:` lines of rolling.yml and release.yml, then
#
#     python tools/check-release-kit-pin.py
tag = v0.23.2
commit = 89a9f9109295e60794f7b3d647ef2404098744b8
